          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to watch. Main/Sub PC = an instruction fetch at the address, Mem R/W = a bus access, IO R/W = a port access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "監視対象。Main/Sub PC = そのアドレスの命令フェッチ、Mem R/W = バスアクセス、IO R/W = ポートアクセス。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which CPU to disassemble. Main is the Z80 running the game, Sub is the sub board Z80 running DISK.ROM.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逆アセンブルする CPU。Main はゲームを実行する Z80、Sub は DISK.ROM を実行するサブボードの Z80。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which CPU's instruction history to show. Main and Sub each have a 1024-entry ring buffer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示する命令履歴の CPU。Main と Sub はそれぞれ 1024 件のリングバッファを持つ。"
